              "short": "$14\\frac{2}{7}$ m",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{7}&=\\frac{100}{7}\\\\\\frac{x}{7}&=14\\frac{2}{7}\\end{align*}$$\nEach part is $14\\frac{2}{7}$ m long.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 30
          }
        ]
      }
